  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Ti sen meggai espasio guini para un peliku'la ha'. Pega un USB drive gi box — format komo FAT32, ni ha aksepta kada Android box — ya u annok gi sanhilo' para un na'tunok guihi.",
